-- Imports the prelude and calls nothing in it. Exported against a copy of
-- the libraries whose `prelude.l4` is not the compiled-in copy, the report
-- says so in an Advisory D-NOT-LIBRARY note, and nothing in the model is
-- refused, so `--fail-on blocking` passes.
IMPORT prelude

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `doubled` x IS x TIMES 2
